id: pm-e63v1x
title: Stabilize generated changelog dates before and after release tag creation
description: "Release preparation and post-tag changelog generation must agree on the calendar release heading. The shipped exact-tag workflow fix regenerates canonical output under a tracked-path allowlist. On 2026-09-06, ordinary main CI still failed after preparation committed an undated heading and creation of v2026.9.6 made canonical generation add the date. Pass the target calendar version date to the package-owned generator before tagging; preserve exact-tag regeneration and strict branch drift checks. The existing immutable release is never moved or republished."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: changelog,exact-tag,release,workflow
created_at: "2026-09-04T13:15:31.270Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-06T19:22:32.653Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-06T19:22:31.998Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-06T19:22:31.998Z"
author: "harness:codex"
parent: pm-e70zh5
severity: high
environment: Auto Release preparation and main CI after immutable tag creation
repro_steps: "Prepare a calendar release before its tag exists, then run changelog:pm:check after the tag is created; the undated heading differs from canonical tag-date output."
resolution: "Release preparation requests the calendar-version date before tagging, preserving canonical post-tag output and strict main CI changelog verification; the existing exact-tag regeneration guard remains intact."
expected_result: "A same-day calendar release has byte-identical generated changelog content before and after its tag is created, and future release commits pass the ordinary changelog check."
actual_result: The old preparation path fails the date regression; the fixed path passes 183 release/provenance/workflow tests and an isolated real-generator pre-tag/post-tag equality check. All 8506 tests pass with full coverage and repository static quality passes using an isolated tracker copy. The published 2026.9.6 tag is unchanged.
affected_version: 2026.9.6
component: release-automation
regression: true
customer_impact: "The validated SDK/CLI release cannot reach npm, bunx/npx consumers, or GitHub Release until exact-tag recovery succeeds."
