  tests/integration/release-automation-contract.spec.ts,project,Execute tag-push and reviewed-main changelog source modes with mutation negative control
  tests/unit/scripts/release/run-release-pipeline.spec.ts,project,Require the committed pre-tag changelog to retain the generated calendar date
